<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-18T21:38:29.089Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 18 Oct 2026 21:38:29 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Three men were sentenced to 158 years each for murdering Australian and U.S. surfers in Mexico, while a Jalisco cartel hitman at a ranch confessed to hundreds of executions. A former Chihuahua attorney general was arrested for permitting an unauthorized CIA role in a drug raid, and a suspected CJNG tunnel builder was detained. Ukraine-origin fiber-optic drones have been reported in use by Mexican narco groups, and a top Jalisco cartel leader known as El Jardinero was captured. The conflict produced 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE5qWmRWclljRkZMZEFkU00zYXloZ3RuTmJrWkdNQVpQVjBvSS16UVdEd3g0VVROa3ZjaTdVejE4YWgwRVFZNWxYV3NVQVRJRGJnaHB5Q1lUTkhXU0NCeTktMnFHQmFzVTBoUHdkSTBUWWN3NUkzVW9YWnFhTldVdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1mRFYxTDFEdG5OV1JvTUdxLVBwUTFGd2JzRllMTFlJczZmbnFxbk1HTVFZbWNxOTZXa1NkM3lOZFRJbGRfcWs1VlEtd0ltNVhRcFVTaWprS3dUX0ltcVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxPQ2J4RHIwY0c5ZmwzaGg4VmNYbG5kYWNwckU4d3dYSWxyUUVKMDk0U01jcm5fSllLMk91NEFDcDhraTlTS2Foa0dfbkZUQ0Jpa3NHZEp3NkpORkk4bHdzWTJPWlEtTHF5YlQ3SkpwZWYtbm4zb2U2dHBOT3c0ZWs3dEtEY0dvSmxMNGlvYlVDX254N1IyQTNhN2xLWTFncnozWTVsSEJ3dm5JOXhlWjFkMGl2WmpqMmRyRldqNg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;MARCA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNN0lNRzdqX0Jpa3pzR25DeWN4aE51MV9DZHNWSEsxdk01bnpXa1pJTVk5Q3cyajVFX21HalJLcnVvcGdaNXQ0NWFCQUQyUXNCZEdYdXBYWmtPUlNjMlE2WlFYUjlWdnVXSmJMZkd6MDVYek5jbFhMeFpJR3VSMzFhbjR3RkVFaUQ4